  ('1e338ef0-40a6-45e1-b218-446cb098f91b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A group of students is tasked with creating a school motto that embodies perseverance and aspiration, inspired by the poem "Upon this rugged path." They want to capture the essence of overcoming obstacles.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c8d93434-cd73-447a-968c-0696d314364a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A student is struggling to understand the concept of "present tenses" and feels frustrated. They are worried about their English grammar skills, which is one of the learning outcomes for Unit-3.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('424f6c5e-aa3f-4aae-8c7a-714d6fcf0742', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A community organization is planning a fundraiser for a local park. They face numerous challenges, including securing permits, recruiting volunteers, and raising sufficient funds. These "challenges sprawl on every side."$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e4217fde-3c9c-4eab-9b54-a3b387c6ab1f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A teacher is planning a lesson on "appreciating the poem" for Unit-3. They want students to go beyond just answering questions and truly connect with the text.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4f8a37f4-433e-4728-a19c-4df92b6bcc4e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A student, David, is asked to learn new words from the poem and use them in sentences. He finds it difficult to remember new vocabulary and often uses words incorrectly.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('a81f97d3-5ab7-421c-ab6a-0da9bdc60a2b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A group of friends is planning a long-distance hiking trip. They know the trail will be physically demanding, with "mountain steep, the river wide," and they anticipate various "challenges sprawl[ing] on every side."$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b1f01ade-6132-43dc-a046-6f8d030fc76c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Sarah, a budding entrepreneur, launched her first tech startup. Immediately, she faced a 'swarm' of negative reviews from competitors and initial users who found flaws in her product. Her investors began to 'falter' in their support, suggesting she pivot to a less ambitious idea. However, Sarah held firm to her vision, believing her 'destiny was hers to mould.' She viewed each criticism as a 'lesson, a forge of might,' meticulously refining her product based on feedback. Her 'resolve grew deep' with every challenge, determined to 'pierce through barricades' and achieve her 'stars' in the industry.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ba348742-7718-4dd2-aaac-1a446eef6ca3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Mark, an aspiring novelist, received numerous rejection letters from publishers. Friends and family, acting as 'doubters,' questioned his talent and urged him to find a more stable career. Despite these 'barricades' of discouragement, Mark's 'spirit knew no shape, no norm.' He saw each rejection not as a failure, but as a 'spark, a beacon bright,' motivating him to improve his craft. His 'resolve' to tell his story remained 'deep,' and he continued writing tirelessly, pursuing 'nothing less than the stars' of literary success.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3a6a0068-75e7-4619-ac8c-2872264d1bfc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A small community organization, 'Green Roots,' aimed to establish a large public garden. They encountered significant bureaucratic 'barricades' and 'critics' who argued against the project's feasibility. Funding 'faltered,' and progress seemed slow. Yet, the leaders of Green Roots were 'bound by will,' holding the truth that their 'destiny was theirs to mould.' They treated every obstacle as a 'lesson, a forge of might,' strengthening their commitment. Their 'resolve grew deep,' and they worked relentlessly, embodying the spirit of 'no time for sleep' in their pursuit of a vibrant community space.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('4c37ad77-654c-4292-9e3a-1ebd717a991a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Elara, a young scientist, was working on a groundbreaking but highly experimental theory. Many established researchers, acting as 'critics,' dismissed her work as too radical. Her initial experiments often 'faltered,' yielding inconclusive results. However, Elara's 'spirit knew no shape, no norm'; she was not bound by conventional thinking. She saw each failed experiment as a 'setback, a spark, a beacon bright,' guiding her to new hypotheses. Her 'resolve grew deep' with every challenge, driven by the 'stars' of scientific discovery she sought.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
