  ('b37466d9-32c4-40bd-9c65-03ff2c6e909c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Pre-Reading Unit-3 : Sports AND WELLNESS tcsrring Oucomcs | After the poem, I will be able to: ... English-8$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b0275161-265d-4287-b6f3-c1b6fbae9a4a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem 'Upon this rugged path' strongly emphasizes the theme of resilience. The speaker acknowledges the presence of significant obstacles, describing them as a 'mountain steep' and a 'river wide,' with 'challenges sprawl[ing] on every side.' Despite these difficulties, an 'inner fire burns,' and the speaker maintains a 'firm resolve,' suggesting an unwavering spirit that refuses to be defeated. The idea that 'For every fall, the earth returns' further reinforces this theme, highlighting the ability to recover and continue after setbacks.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3b50ba78-34df-4cc6-80b9-c4e14f95988e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A key aspect of the speaker's journey in 'Upon this rugged path' is their high aspiration. With 'eyes on peaks that kiss the sky,' the speaker clearly sets ambitious goals. This strong desire, described as a 'thirst that fuels my climb,' is so powerful that 'No tempest fierce, no tear, no sigh' can diminish it. The poem illustrates that true ambition is not easily swayed by external difficulties or emotional distress, driving the individual through 'storms of fate' and 'tests of time'.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('406c36ee-08c3-4588-8f2b-13975b74337a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Let doubters speak, let critics swarm, My spirit knows no shape, no norm. Bound by will, this truth I hold: My destiny is mine to mould. Each failure, a lesson, a forge of might, Each setback, a spark, a beacon bright. With every effort, my resolve grows deep, Awake in my dreams no time for sleep.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6e50d89e-9f08-45c2-bdbf-869fea4293f9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$So hear this heart that beats so fierce, Through barricades, I will pierce. For nothing less than the stars I seek, In the dance of the brave, the waltz of the meek. Symbolism is a literary device where symbols represent ideas or qualities. Symbols can be objects, characters, figures or colours used to convey deeper meanings, a range of emotional or cultural significances and to express complex ideas visually. For example, ‘the stars’ symbolise high aspirations in the poem.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e2bf26fa-72a0-484f-82ad-f8ad36987237', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem emphasizes a powerful message of individual agency and resilience. The speaker actively rejects the influence of 'doubters' and 'critics,' asserting personal control over their future. Instead of being discouraged, failures and setbacks are reframed as essential components for growth, serving as 'lessons' and 'beacons' that strengthen one's 'resolve.' This unwavering determination drives the speaker to overcome obstacles and pursue ambitious goals.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('433954e5-8b47-4d5f-bab4-57d09cc577fb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Vocabulary is crucial for understanding the poem's depth. Words like 'barricades' (a barrier constructed to block a path) and 'pierce' (to pass into or through something) highlight the speaker's confrontational approach to obstacles. 'Resolve' (firm willpower to do something) underscores the speaker's inner strength, while 'critics' (people who judge the qualities and faults of something) represent the external negativity the speaker dismisses. Understanding these terms enriches the reader's comprehension of the poem's themes.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f99322f3-1acc-4f21-b110-7076d04fa2ec', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The literary device of symbolism is key to unlocking deeper meanings in texts. It allows authors to use concrete elements—such as objects, characters, or even colors—to represent abstract ideas or qualities. This technique goes beyond literal interpretation, conveying emotional or cultural significances and expressing complex ideas visually. For instance, in the poem, 'the stars' are not merely celestial bodies but powerful symbols of high aspirations and ambitious goals.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('44bf0674-5758-4d77-9194-ac001c433436', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's opening lines, 'Let doubters speak, let critics swarm, My spirit knows no shape, no norm,' immediately establish a defiant and independent tone. The speaker's spirit is portrayed as unconstrained by conventional expectations or external judgments. This declaration sets the stage for a narrative of self-reliance and personal conviction, where the individual's inner truth and will are paramount over societal pressures.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ed5c7b71-cfdd-445f-9828-d67fe263587e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The lines 'Bound by will, this truth I hold: My destiny is mine to mould' articulate a core philosophy of personal empowerment. The speaker asserts complete control over their future, emphasizing that their path is shaped by their own 'will' and determination, rather than by fate or external circumstances. This belief in self-determination is a cornerstone of the poem's message, encouraging readers to take ownership of their lives.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c1fb4f6a-2420-4ed0-910b-ec7f80770dc5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem presents a unique perspective on adversity: 'Each failure, a lesson, a forge of might, Each setback, a spark, a beacon bright.' Here, failures and setbacks are not seen as deterrents but as catalysts for growth and strength. They are transformed into learning experiences ('lesson'), sources of power ('forge of might'), and guiding lights ('beacon bright'), illustrating a profound resilience and an ability to extract positive outcomes from negative experiences.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('0beb89c3-6523-4b00-8640-61ee60d8b881', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The speaker's dedication is evident in the lines, 'With every effort, my resolve grows deep, Awake in my dreams no time for sleep.' This suggests a relentless pursuit of goals, where commitment intensifies with each endeavor. The phrase 'Awake in my dreams no time for sleep' is a powerful hyperbole, indicating that the speaker's aspirations consume their thoughts even in their subconscious, leaving no room for idleness or rest in their pursuit of greatness.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('2b05510f-1bc8-483b-8b12-7db676a4898f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem culminates in a declaration of courage and ambition: 'So hear this heart that beats so fierce, Through barricades, I will pierce. For nothing less than the stars I seek, In the dance of the brave, the waltz of the meek.' The 'fierce' heart symbolizes intense passion and bravery. The speaker's intention to 'pierce through barricades' signifies a direct and determined approach to overcoming obstacles. The ultimate goal is 'nothing less than the stars,' representing the highest aspirations, achievable by both the bold ('brave') and the gentle ('meek').$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('138a1081-8a51-42dd-a068-ec15bb0a92c7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The provided vocabulary list offers essential tools for interpreting the poem. For instance, 'swarm' describes the dense gathering of critics, emphasizing their overwhelming presence. 'Faltered' highlights moments of hesitation or weakness, which the speaker overcomes. 'Rugged' and 'tempest' evoke challenging environments, while 'meek' and 'waltz' add nuance to the final lines, suggesting that even gentle approaches can lead to success. These definitions clarify the imagery and actions within the poem.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('648d5c33-34f4-454d-bef5-6d78fc580fb2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Symbolism is a versatile literary device. It allows writers to imbue ordinary objects, characters, or even colors with profound, non-literal meanings. This depth enriches the reader's experience by inviting interpretation and reflection. Beyond conveying simple ideas, symbols can evoke a range of emotional responses and cultural associations, making complex concepts more accessible and memorable through visual representation.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('5761ea52-8caa-4879-86a4-95883960b8a7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's message of self-empowerment is deeply rooted in the speaker's internal conviction. The phrase 'Bound by will' suggests that the speaker's actions and beliefs are not arbitrary but are firmly anchored by a strong inner drive. This 'will' acts as a personal compass, guiding the speaker through external pressures and ensuring adherence to their own 'truth,' which is the belief in shaping their own 'destiny.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('45e0c3f4-34df-452a-a00b-c3b6a8b8ebbf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem presents a dynamic relationship between effort and resolve. It states, 'With every effort, my resolve grows deep.' This indicates that determination is not static but strengthens through consistent action and perseverance. Each act of striving, regardless of immediate outcome, contributes to a deeper, more entrenched willpower, reinforcing the speaker's capacity to face future challenges with even greater fortitude.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('884287f4-dadf-4df3-b88c-a10c901c55ed', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The speaker's ultimate aspiration, 'For nothing less than the stars I seek,' signifies an uncompromising ambition. 'The stars' here are a powerful symbol of the highest possible achievements, dreams, or ideals. This line conveys a refusal to settle for mediocrity or lesser goals, emphasizing a relentless pursuit of excellence and a commitment to reaching one's full potential, regardless of the perceived difficulty.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('8bf7c249-431f-4abc-b3aa-0be7b05f491b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's concluding line, 'In the dance of the brave, the waltz of the meek,' offers a nuanced perspective on achieving success. 'The brave' represent those who are bold and confrontational, while 'the meek' symbolize those who are quiet and gentle. By including both, the poem suggests that high aspirations are accessible to individuals of diverse temperaments and approaches, implying that success is not exclusive to one personality type but can be attained through various forms of determination.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d30210e3-635f-4e28-8054-cb3fa94fe8b8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The definition of 'critics' as 'people who judge the qualities and faults of something' is crucial for understanding the poem's opening. The speaker acknowledges their existence but chooses to disregard their 'swarm.' This highlights a deliberate choice to prioritize internal validation over external judgment, a key aspect of the poem's theme of self-reliance and unwavering personal vision.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7502e143-a0ed-4414-a3de-13c16737592e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The word 'pierce' (to pass into or through something) is used actively by the speaker: 'Through barricades, I will pierce.' This verb choice conveys a forceful and direct approach to overcoming obstacles. It suggests not avoiding or circumventing challenges, but confronting them head-on and breaking through them with determination, reinforcing the speaker's resolute and unyielding spirit.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1cb4c2a3-df5c-49da-85c5-cf3c3d155c55', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's imagery of 'a forge of might' for failures and 'a beacon bright' for setbacks creates powerful visual metaphors. A 'forge' is where metal is shaped and strengthened by intense heat, implying that difficulties refine and empower the individual. A 'beacon' is a guiding light, suggesting that challenges, though difficult, illuminate the path forward and provide direction. These images transform adversity into sources of strength and guidance.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f4295572-acb0-4853-8a58-c7b9bc6e019b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The vocabulary word 'evolve' (to develop gradually) can be applied to the speaker's journey. The poem describes a process where 'resolve grows deep' and failures become 'lessons.' This gradual development and learning from experience align with the concept of evolution, suggesting that the speaker's strength and wisdom are not instantaneous but are cultivated over time through continuous effort and reflection.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('a5fb4c83-1ef5-4f2a-bdf6-4541136f41e2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The speaker's 'spirit knows no shape, no norm' implies a profound sense of individuality and freedom from conventional constraints. This suggests an unconventional mindset, unafraid to deviate from established paths or expectations. It highlights a creative and independent spirit that defines its own boundaries and rules, rather than conforming to external molds, which is central to the poem's theme of self-determination.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d93ab147-7269-467a-940f-3b8bcfb1b650', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's message is one of unwavering optimism and proactive engagement with life. It encourages readers to embrace challenges, learn from every experience, and maintain a strong internal drive. By presenting failures as opportunities and obstacles as pathways to growth, the poem inspires a resilient mindset, urging individuals to actively 'mould' their own 'destiny' and pursue their highest 'stars' with fierce determination.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('035e24c6-d580-44af-8b21-a79335002217', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The definition of 'faltered' (hesitated) is relevant to understanding moments of potential doubt or weakness that the speaker might encounter. However, the poem consistently shows the speaker overcoming such hesitation with renewed 'resolve.' This contrast highlights the speaker's inner strength and commitment, demonstrating that even if there are moments of wavering, the underlying willpower remains firm and ultimately prevails.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e2f143fb-4dba-4767-bd1e-20a03ac994e8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The term 'rugged' (a rough, uneven surface) from the vocabulary list can be metaphorically applied to the challenging path the speaker traverses. While not explicitly mentioned in the poem, the idea of 'barricades' and 'setbacks' suggests a journey that is far from smooth. A 'rugged' path implies difficulties and uneven terrain, reinforcing the idea that the speaker's journey to 'the stars' is demanding and requires immense fortitude.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e6a4e19a-1f48-4e2b-b482-b44b349fe3b1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The word 'tempest' (a violent windy storm) from the vocabulary list can symbolize the intense difficulties or periods of turmoil the speaker might face. Just as a physical tempest can create chaos, the speaker's journey is likely to encounter metaphorical storms of criticism, doubt, or failure. The speaker's ability to 'pierce through barricades' suggests resilience even in the face of such overwhelming 'tempests.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f0e72375-d667-4956-93ff-48b55f1905f0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's use of 'will' as a binding force is central to its message of self-determination. The speaker is 'Bound by will,' indicating that their actions and beliefs are not dictated by external forces but by an internal, conscious choice. This 'will' is the source of their 'truth' and the instrument through which they 'mould' their 'destiny,' highlighting the power of individual volition in shaping one's life.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d529e019-c164-4b0a-891e-fd14899ac4b6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The phrase 'heart that beats so fierce' vividly portrays the speaker's intense passion and courage. A 'fierce' heart suggests an unyielding spirit, burning with determination and a strong emotional drive to achieve goals. This imagery reinforces the idea that the speaker's pursuit of 'the stars' is not merely intellectual but deeply felt and passionately driven, providing the energy to 'pierce through barricades.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6c392da9-5f5f-40a9-83b7-6fcb9b7422ad', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's message is universally applicable, transcending specific contexts. Its themes of resilience, self-belief, and the transformative power of adversity resonate with anyone facing personal or professional challenges. By presenting a framework where failures are lessons and setbacks are sparks, the poem offers a timeless blueprint for navigating difficulties and striving for excellence in any endeavor.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ae733b20-d85c-4413-9f1b-de3b44942693', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The definition of 'sprawl' (to spread out over a large area in an untidy or irregular way) can be used to describe the unorganized or widespread nature of challenges or negative influences. For instance, 'critics swarm' and 'barricades' can 'sprawl' across one's path, creating a daunting landscape. The speaker's determination to 'pierce' through these suggests a focused effort against a potentially sprawling and overwhelming opposition.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('669d24d8-ebd0-4b76-96d3-fda8b13edb16', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's use of 'beacon bright' for each setback is a powerful symbol of hope and guidance. A beacon is a signal fire or light, typically on a hill or tower, used to guide ships or warn of danger. In the poem, setbacks, instead of causing despair, illuminate the path forward, providing clarity and direction. This transforms negative experiences into sources of enlightenment, showing the speaker how to navigate towards their 'stars.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('94d3d464-2d3c-4fe8-894f-db78929750e4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's emphasis on 'every effort' highlights the importance of consistent and sustained action. It is not a single grand gesture but a continuous series of efforts that leads to the deepening of 'resolve.' This iterative process of striving and strengthening underscores the idea that perseverance is key to building inner fortitude and ultimately achieving ambitious goals, reinforcing the theme of hard work and dedication.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('95261fcb-718d-4b25-a7ec-10057119c682', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's rejection of 'shape' and 'norm' for the speaker's spirit is a declaration of non-conformity. It implies that the speaker refuses to be confined by societal expectations, predefined roles, or conventional paths. This freedom from external molds allows the speaker to forge a unique identity and pursue a 'destiny' that is truly their own, embodying an independent and authentic approach to life.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f9137c7b-fa4a-4678-9466-6819b7cd5e11', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's message about 'moulding' one's destiny is an active call to action. It implies that destiny is not a fixed outcome but a malleable entity that can be shaped through conscious choices and persistent effort. This empowers the individual to take charge, make decisions, and actively work towards their desired future, rather than passively accepting whatever comes their way, reinforcing the theme of personal agency.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b19f1a1f-06af-4639-b033-873ec02d83b2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem effectively uses strong, active verbs to convey its message of determination. Verbs like 'swarm,' 'mould,' 'forge,' 'pierce,' and 'seek' create a sense of dynamism and purpose. 'Swarm' vividly describes the critics, while 'mould' and 'forge' emphasize creation and strengthening. 'Pierce' denotes forceful action against obstacles, and 'seek' highlights the relentless pursuit of goals. These verbs collectively build a powerful narrative of an individual in active control of their journey.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('5e7506ff-3d8a-416b-8606-226c262c8e0e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's opening lines, 'Let doubters speak, let critics swarm,' serve as an immediate dismissal of external negativity. This direct address acknowledges the presence of opposition but simultaneously diminishes its power. By allowing 'doubters' and 'critics' to 'speak' and 'swarm,' the speaker demonstrates a confidence that their words cannot penetrate the speaker's inner conviction, setting a tone of defiance and self-assurance.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('2f3e95db-8c35-402d-8d53-4233eb0eb223', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's message of turning 'failures' into 'lessons' and 'setbacks' into 'sparks' is a powerful lesson in reframing adversity. It encourages a growth mindset, where every negative experience is viewed as an opportunity for learning and improvement, rather than a definitive end. This reframing is crucial for maintaining motivation and building resilience, transforming potential discouragement into fuel for future endeavors.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('64ebc525-906b-4452-99d8-51e048a7c5e7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's consistent emphasis on 'will' and 'resolve' highlights the importance of internal strength. In a world where external factors often seem overwhelming, the poem champions the power of individual determination. It suggests that true strength comes from an unwavering inner commitment, which enables one to withstand external pressures and actively shape their own path, regardless of the challenges encountered.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b205ffd3-331c-4fa2-9917-1e7e0680b2ef', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's final image of 'the dance of the brave, the waltz of the meek' is a beautiful illustration of inclusivity in aspiration. It suggests that success is not limited to those who are overtly powerful or aggressive ('brave'), but also extends to those who might be perceived as gentle or unassuming ('meek'). This implies that different approaches and personalities can all lead to the achievement of high goals, celebrating diversity in the pursuit of 'the stars.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('06827bb0-dcd7-4925-82cd-7f7e71808e69', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', 'e7f15a92-3fd2-46f3-b661-9060b077f73b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The poem's academic English style is evident in its precise vocabulary and clear articulation of abstract concepts. Phrases like 'forge of might' and 'beacon bright' are carefully chosen metaphors that convey complex ideas concisely. The definitions provided for vocabulary words further reinforce this academic tone, ensuring clarity and exactness in understanding the poem's profound message about resilience and self-determination.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-53-312Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL);
